        "text": "Akshi Beach (3.7 km away) and Revdanda Beach (9 km away) are the closest beaches to Nagaon. The main Alibaug Beach is about 8.8 km north of Nagaon. All are top places to visit near Nagaon Beach."
      }
    },
    {
