      "name": "Which is better: Nagaon Beach or Kashid Beach?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "It depends entirely on your travel style! Nagaon Beach is better for families, group stays, and safe water sports due to its exceptionally flat sand profile, gentle waves, and proximity to great stays like Dolphin House. Kashid Beach is ideal for a quick day trip to see open, rocky waves and cliffs, though it has much steeper drop-offs in the water."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "How far is Murud-Janjira Fort from Nagaon Beach?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Murud-Janjira Fort is approximately 45 km from Nagaon Beach. It takes about 1 hour and 15 minutes to travel by road to the Murud jetty, followed by a short, traditional sailboat ride to the marine fortress."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Where is the best place for Dolphin watching in Alibaug?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Nagaon Beach is the premier launch point for dolphin watching in Alibaug. Local boats take travelers into the deeper Arabian Sea waters early in the morning (between 7:00 AM and 9:00 AM) when dolphin sightings are most frequent."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "What are the best places to visit in Alibaug for couples?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "For couples visiting Alibaug, the quiet coconut groves of Akshi Beach offer incredible privacy. Other romantic highlights include watching the sunset through the ruins of Revdanda Fort and exploring the secluded stretches of Kashid Beach."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Which is the best beach in Konkan for family trips?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "Nagaon Beach is widely considered the best beach in the Konkan region for families. Its flat, hard-sand incline makes it exceptionally safe for children to wade in, and it features the highest concentration of organized beach rides and safety-monitored water sports."
      }
    },
    {
      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Is it spelled Alibaug, Alibag, Alibaugh, or Alibagh?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
